---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="RC Aircraft — Jet Aerospace" description="Design and development of a fully functional RC aircraft at Jet Aerospace.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="tag mb-3">Aerospace · Systems · Jet Aerospace</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-hi)]">RC Aircraft Design & Development</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--text-mid)]">Internship · Kerala, India · 2025</p>

    <div class="rule my-10"></div>

    <section class="space-y-3 mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-lg text-[var(--amber)]">Overview</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--text-mid)] leading-relaxed">
        At Jet Aerospace's drone manufacturing hub, I designed and developed a fully functional RC aircraft,
        carrying it from aerodynamic concept through to a flight-ready prototype.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3 mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-lg text-[var(--amber)]">Scope</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[var(--text-mid)] space-y-1.5">
        <li>Aerodynamic design and CAD modeling of airframe components</li>
        <li>Lightweight structural design</li>
        <li>Propulsion, ESC, and servo integration</li>
        <li>RC control system integration</li>
        <li>Flight testing and control-response evaluation</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <img src={`${base}media/rc-plane-1.jpeg`} alt="RC aircraft component during assembly and testing" class="w-full border border-[var(--line)]" />
      <p class="tag mt-2">On-site at Jet Aerospace, Palakkad, Kerala</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <img src={`${base}media/rc-plane-7.jpeg`} alt="RC aircraft assembly showing airframe and control surfaces" class="w-full border border-[var(--line)]" />
    </section>

    <a href={`${base}#projects`} class="tag inline-block mt-6">&larr; Back to projects</a>
  </article>
</Layout>
